# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system 7e9e71cc67cac92a750b7a2428d651614dd2e0b751fe6af3c2ff4cf1ca663bf6
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server cbd511e40b4917c678a00bdf0dd6b807b123cd955c8a2a664393186eb988a7bf
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm c8c223e60170aea474ac268090582d548f0d924a4cdf0682eb75fd8feca6f7cc
